# Normalise line endings to LF everywhere.
#
# Without this, a clone under a Windows-style `core.autocrlf` setting rewrites
# the data CSVs with CRLF endings on checkout. That changes their bytes, breaks
# checksum comparisons, and produces whole-file diffs on files that did not
# change. The data files are deliverable inputs, so they must round-trip exactly.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.csv text eol=lf
*.py  text eol=lf
*.md  text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.pdf binary
*.ipynb text eol=lf
